true] [17592186748221 1072 #uuid "2290f49d-c263-51d2-8038-81eb1905aa45" 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748221 1074 "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nFirst keep the original domain: $y + 1\\ne0$.\n\nRearranging once, test whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(c)= \\\\ 1 - \\frac{1}{\\left(c + 1\\right)^{2}}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\n- For $c=2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(2) &=- \\frac{1}{9} + 1 \\\\ &=\\frac{8}{9}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-2) &=-1 + 1 \\\\ &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-3) &=- \\frac{1}{4} + 1 \\\\ &=\\frac{3}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=-2$." 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748222 1080 "false" 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748222 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748222 1083 #uuid "23b47a0c-1cbe-585b-84bc-1e074ef49f53" 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748223 1075 #edb/ref 17592186748339 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748223 1075 #edb/ref 17592186748345 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748223 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748223 1077 "$y=-3$" 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748223 1078 #edb/ref 17592186748339 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748223 1079 #uuid "2552fa73-7483-5558-a3b6-499c5a97898e" 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748224 1068 #edb/ref 17592186748235 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748224 1068 #edb/ref 17592186748353 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748224 1068 #edb/ref 17592186748355 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592186748224 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139545665 17592186576411 true] [17592